    "en": {
      "trackName": "Watch - Dash",
      "description": "Chomp your way through a classic maze—right on your Apple Watch!\nWatch DotMan brings the timeless arcade action to your wrist. Swipe to guide your hungry hero through a retro maze, gobbling up dots, dodging ghosts, and grabbing power-ups for a high score. Compete with friends on the global leaderboard and see who’s the ultimate maze master!\n\nFeatures:\nIntuitive swipe controls designed for Apple Watch\nClassic maze layout and dot-chomping gameplay\nPower-up mode: turn the tables and chase the ghosts!\nAnimated, colorful graphics and smooth performance\nHaptic feedback for immersive play\nTrack your best scores and climb the leaderboard\nQuick, fun sessions—perfect for on-the-go gaming\n\nWhether you’re a retro arcade fan or new to maze games, Watch DotMan is the perfect way to relive the fun, anytime, anywhere.",
